# ============================================================
# Only site-essential files belong in this repo.
# Internal notes, scripts, design briefs stay in Google Drive
# (the working folder), never here. The rules below are a
# safety net so they can never be committed by accident.
# ============================================================

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*~

# Google Drive sync artefacts
.tmp.drivedownload/
*.gdoc
*.gsheet
*.gslides

# Internal tooling - must never reach GitHub
.claude/
*.ps1
*.bat
*.sh
*.psd
*.nef
*.NEF

# Internal docs and notes - keep these in Google Drive only
README.md
PROMPT*.md
*NOTES*.md
*notes*.md
TODO*.md
DRAFT*.md
*.draft.md
launch.json
settings.local.json
*.local.json

# Source / unoptimised assets (only optimised assets ship)
assets-optimized/
assets-source/
photos/
*.tmp
